Package: GaussQuant
Title: Tidy R Interface to QuantLib for Quantitative Finance
Version: 2026.06.18.1
Authors@R: person("Eiichi", "Horigome", email = "besuke.poripori@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reusable tidy R interfaces to QuantLib for
    quantitative finance, including fixed income, derivatives, credit,
    interest-rate curve construction, portfolio analytics, pricing engines,
    cashflows, and risk analytics. It also supports differentiable pricing
    and automatic differentiation workflows using torch. GaussQuant is
    the formal successor to QuantLibGauss and uses QuantLib directly
    without depending on QuantLibGauss.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.3)
Imports:
    QuantLib,
    tibble,
    dplyr,
    purrr,
    furrr,
    future,
    lubridate,
    torch,
    PortfolioAnalytics,
    PerformanceAnalytics
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0